Source: `node-vessel-identity.ts` (all writers; 13 hint sites; the `orphanPersonaRoots` regex; header doc :42-46, :112-117, :663, :850, :987-1004) · `vault-carriers.ts:234-237` `loginKeyed`/`faceLoginKeyed`, rows :310/316/319/397-404/471 → `exact`-style matchers · `face-bundle-cut.ts`, `realm-steward.ts`, `signer-class.ts` name row/class ids only (no change).
Python (sensorium): `lares_uds.py:110` globs `.vessel-key-*.json` — matches ONLY suffixed names, so it breaks on the cut; becomes `.vessel-key.json`. `worldline_veil.py:44` globs `.persona-group-root-*.json` at the identity top level and reads a clear `signingKey`; the root now rests sealed per face, so it already reads nothing today (flag, out of slice).
Tools/e2e/CLI: `tools/contract-witness.sh:239` `.vessel-key*.json` (still matches) · `tools/mesh-scenarios.sh:1592` and `tests/e2e/vessel-sealed.test.ts:78` roster regex with optional login (tighten) · `tests/e2e/herm-floor.test.ts:288` (prefix, fine) · `packages/lares-cli/tests/vault-door.test.ts:219-229` plants `.vessel-key-x.json` (→ `.vessel-key.json`) · `vessel-rotate-door.test.ts:85` (prefix, fine) · `tools/s-vocabulary.mjs:8` comment.
Seed census (`tools/seed-census.mjs`): no login handling, nothing to move. Custody census (`tools/custody-census*.mjs`): row ids only, nothing to move.
Tests pinning the bug: `place-rotation.test.ts:56-60` asserts the flipped read REJECTS (the bug as control) → retarget to "a flip moves nothing"; `vault-carriers.test.ts:86,101-104` fixtures `-joshua-h0` → bare; `hermetic-git-global.test.ts` header text (its law, a null global for suites, stays while displayName reads git).
Canon text naming the suffix (hand to controller, lanes edit no canon): `docs/pono/heraldry.mem`, `lararium/mesh/mookuauhau.mem` (history meme stays as history).

